# Netlify response headers for every page and file.
#
# Stops other websites from putting Tandem inside a frame (a page that
# overlays invisible buttons on top of a signed-in Tandem and tricks someone
# into clicking them). Tandem opens outside tools in its own frame; that is
# unaffected, since these headers govern who may frame Tandem, not what
# Tandem frames.
/*
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'none'
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
